WEBVTT

00:08:28.828 --> 00:08:31.878
You can't just give them
the opposite hormones that young.

00:08:31.902 --> 00:08:33.737
They'll end up stunted in growth,

00:08:33.761 --> 00:08:36.309
and you think you can have
a meaningful conversation

00:08:36.333 --> 00:08:38.823
about the fertility effects
of such treatment

00:08:38.847 --> 00:08:42.242
with a 10-year-old girl,
a 12-year-old boy?

00:08:42.663 --> 00:08:45.169
So this buys time
in the diagnostic process

00:08:45.193 --> 00:08:47.021
for four or five years,

00:08:47.045 --> 00:08:49.343
so that they can work it out.

00:08:49.819 --> 00:08:52.447
They can have more and more testing,

00:08:52.471 --> 00:08:56.440
they can live without feeling their bodies
are running away from them.

00:08:56.464 --> 00:09:00.622
And then, in a program they call 12-16-18,